foot is a fast, lightweight wayland terminal emulator, and the default terminal in dwl's
configuration. Built without docs, utmp logging, grapheme clustering and its own
terminfo files (it announces itself as xterm-256color instead). Installs foot,
footclient, its themes and a default foot.ini under /usr/local. Needs a font such as
misc-dejavu-fonts to draw anything.
